# Vulnerabilities accepted against the component images.
#
# Every entry needs the identifier, who accepted it, when, and why. An entry
# with no reason is indistinguishable from one added to make a build go green,
# and the point of this file is that the difference stays visible.
#
# The scan already passes --ignore-unfixed, so anything with no fix available
# is out of scope here and does not need an entry. This file is only for
# findings that could be fixed and are deliberately not being fixed yet.
#
# Format:
#
#   # <why this is accepted, and what would change it>
#   # accepted by: <name>, <date>
#   CVE-0000-00000
#
# Entries are reviewed when the weekly scan runs. An entry whose reason no
# longer holds should be removed rather than left to age.
